    "content": "<p>Get a sneak peek at the development of War Robots: Frontiers in Early Access.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This video will give you a behind-the-scenes look from Zukata, the Creative Director of War Robots: Frontiers. Check out the roadmap for the months ahead, learn about Pioneer Packs and all the rewards you can claim, and even more from the world of War Robots: Frontiers in Early Access!</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"embeddedContent oembed-provider-youtube\" data-align=\"center\" data-oembed=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1wWL3fGLbYI\" data-oembed_provider=\"youtube\" data-resizetype=\"noresize\" style=\"text-align:center\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/1wWL3fGLbYI?wmode=transparent&amp;jqoemcache=PrNdp\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<p>Subscribe to our <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7xxqQkPAQ7x6wIVEPZus5w\">YouTube channel</a> and stay tuned for more War Robots: Frontiers videos!</p>",
